# BEXTR -- override (BMI: Intel SDM Vol. 2, BEXTR)
# The manual's Operation is written bit by bit (loops, variable bit ranges);
# v1's ALU computes it in one operation (rtl/v1/v1_alu.sv, U_BEXTR), with the
# flags of the page's Flags Affected section (restated below in the words the
# flags oracle reads: the ALU produces the cleared ones as 0).
@operation
DEST := AluOp(BEXTR, SRC1, SRC2);
@flags
The CF, ZF and OF flags are set according to the result. The AF, SF and PF flags are undefined.
